      "qualified": true,
      "reply_blank": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2119905908364849340",
      "reply_with_suggestion": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2119905908364849340&text=And%20the%20convenience%20gap%20is%20smaller%20than%20it%20looks.%20A%20basic%20self-custody%20setup%20takes%20an%20afternoon%20to%20learn%3B%20an%20ETF%20share%20is%20a%20claim%20you%20can%27t%20move%2C%20spend%20or%20verify%20yourself.%20I%20wrote%20a%20book%20on%20building%20your%20own%20air-gapped%20setup%20without%20exchanges%20or%20hardware%20vendors%2C%20free%20on%20Kindle%20until%20Wednesday%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2Fdp%2FB0HQ5NS31N%3FdplnkId%3Dc09ef739-11f3-4c76-8c62-92ce160a3341%26nodl%3D1",
      "source_post_id": null,
      "suggested_text": "And the convenience gap is smaller than it looks. A basic self-custody setup takes an afternoon to learn; an ETF share is a claim you can't move, spend or verify yourself. I wrote a book on building your own air-gapped setup without exchanges or hardware vendors, free on Kindle until Wednesday: https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HQ5NS31N?dplnkId=c09ef739-11f3-4c76-8c62-92ce160a3341&nodl=1",
      "timestamp_source": "x.get_posts_by_ids",
      "topic": "custodia",
      "url": "https://x.com/SimplyBitcoin/status/2119905908364849340"
    },
    "2119921081587048677": {
      "author": "Diditaihuttu",
      "context": "Didi Taihuttu recuerda que en 2017 vendió todo, entró all-in en Bitcoin y se lo tatuó en el brazo; dice que sigue sin cuenta bancaria ni planes de tenerla y cierra con «Not your keys, not your coins».",
