      "qualified": true,
      "reply_blank": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2119921081587048677",
      "reply_with_suggestion": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2119921081587048677&text=The%20tattoo%20is%20the%20easy%20part%3B%20the%20keys%20are%20the%20real%20commitment.%20Holding%20them%20means%20owning%20the%20backup%2C%20the%20inheritance%20plan%20and%20the%20opsec%20too.%20Curious%20what%20setup%20you%27ve%20settled%20on%20after%20all%20these%20years%3F",
      "source_post_id": null,
      "suggested_text": "The tattoo is the easy part; the keys are the real commitment. Holding them means owning the backup, the inheritance plan and the opsec too. Curious what setup you've settled on after all these years?",
