      "reply_with_suggestion": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2119927385919262931&text=Useful%20signal%2C%20with%20one%20caveat%3A%20address%20cohorts%20can%20shift%20when%20custodians%20reshuffle%20coins%2C%20so%20it%20reads%20best%20next%20to%20exchange%20balances.%20The%20%2475K%20hold%20is%20the%20cleaner%20test.%20Will%20be%20watching%20whether%20the%201%20to%20100%20BTC%20trend%20survives%20the%20next%20leg%20down%2C%20if%20there%20is%20one.",
      "source_post_id": null,
      "suggested_text": "Useful signal, with one caveat: address cohorts can shift when custodians reshuffle coins, so it reads best next to exchange balances. The $75K hold is the cleaner test. Will be watching whether the 1 to 100 BTC trend survives the next leg down, if there is one.",
