      "qualified": true,
      "reply_blank": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2119932070713610466",
      "reply_with_suggestion": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2119932070713610466&text=The%20shallower%2C%20faster%20drawdown%20is%20the%20most%20interesting%20part%20of%20this.%20Four%20cycles%20is%20still%20a%20small%20sample%2C%20and%20each%20halving%20cuts%20a%20smaller%20share%20of%20new%20supply%2C%20so%20I%27d%20treat%20the%20timeline%20as%20a%20scenario%2C%20not%20a%20schedule.",
      "source_post_id": null,
      "suggested_text": "The shallower, faster drawdown is the most interesting part of this. Four cycles is still a small sample, and each halving cuts a smaller share of new supply, so I'd treat the timeline as a scenario, not a schedule.",
